# recording on the first note: COUNT (REC held, knob 2) "on note": REC + PLAY waits, nothing moves, until a key;
# that note lands on step 1 and the transport runs from there
wait 300
# (WARP-8: a new project is eight kits; this scenario's melodic tracks are sample tracks)
knob 2 engine 6
knob 3 engine 6
knob 4 engine 6
knob 5 engine 6
knob 6 engine 6
knob 7 engine 6
knob 8 engine 6
wait 40
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
tap SEQ
press REC
turn K2 3
wait 60
shot rec_knobs_onnote.png
release REC
press REC
tap PLAY
release REC
expect playing 1
wait 1500
shot waiting.png
key 0 down
wait 120
key 0 up
wait 700
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
expect note 2 1 1 53
